| observed | setosa | versicolor | virginica |
| :--- | ---: | ---: | ---: |
| setosa | 50 | 0 | 0 |
| versicolor | 0 | 48 | 2 |
| virginica | 0 | 4 | 46 |


Wine, leave-one-out accuracy:

| k | standardised, 13 predictors | raw, 13 predictors | proline alone |
| ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |
| 1 | 0.9551 | 0.7697 | 0.6685 |
